NAME
    gcloud beta kms retired-resources - manage retired resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta kms retired-resources COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) A retired resource represents a deleted key version.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        (BETA) Get metadata for a given retired resource.

     list
        (BETA) List the retired resources within a location.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice. These
    variants are also available:

        $ gcloud kms retired-resources

        $ gcloud alpha kms retired-resources

